{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39993","headline":"邑宰相访翼日有寄 · 徐夤","name":"邑宰相访翼日有寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渊明深念郤诜贫，踏破莓苔看甑尘。\n碧沼共攀红菡萏，金鞍不卸紫麒麟。\n残阳妬害催归客，薄酒甘尝罚主人。\n夜半梦醒追复想，欲长攀接有何因。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}